# Normalize line endings.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` (.prettierrc.json) and
# .editorconfig sets `end_of_line = lf`, but Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, so a Windows checkout produced CRLF working copies.
# `pnpm run format:check` then reported essentially every file as unformatted,
# which drowned out the three files that were genuinely misformatted and kept
# CI red (backlog A8). Declaring the policy here makes the checkout match the
# tooling on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.wasm  binary

# Generated; keep out of diffs and reviews.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
